---
/**
 * /about/index.astro — About Us page
 */
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Us - GovFitAI"
  description="About GovFitAI - AI-powered government job matching platform helping job seekers find their perfect government career"
  canonicalUrl="https://govfitai.com/about/"
>
  <section class="hero-gradient">
    <h1>About GovFitAI</h1>
    <p>Empowering Job Seekers with AI-Powered Government Job Matching</p>
  </section>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="card" style="padding:40px;">
      <h2>Our Mission</h2>
      <p>GovFitAI is on a mission to revolutionize how people find government jobs in India. We believe that finding the right job should be simple, personalized, and accessible to everyone. Using cutting-edge AI technology, we match job seekers with government opportunities that perfectly fit their qualifications, education, and career goals.</p>

      <h2>The Problem We Solve</h2>
      <p>Every year, millions of Indians search for government jobs across hundreds of organizations - SSC, Railway, UPSC, PSUs, State PSCs, and more. The process is overwhelming:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✗ Job postings scattered across multiple websites</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✗ Complex eligibility criteria (age, education, percentage, category)</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✗ Missing deadlines due to lack of notifications</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✗ Applying to jobs you're not eligible for</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✗ Wasting time searching instead of preparing</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Our Solution</h2>
      <p>GovFitAI uses artificial intelligence to solve these problems:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✓ <strong>Smart Matching:</strong> AI analyzes your profile and shows ONLY jobs you qualify for</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✓ <strong>Centralized Platform:</strong> All government jobs in one place</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✓ <strong>Real-time Updates:</strong> Never miss a deadline with instant notifications</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✓ <strong>Time Saving:</strong> Focus on preparation, not searching</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">✓ <strong>100% Free:</strong> No hidden charges, ever</li>
      </ul>

      <div class="features" style="margin:30px 0;">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
          <h3>AI-Powered Matching</h3>
          <p>Our algorithm considers age, education, percentage, category, and location to recommend perfect jobs</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
          <h3>Instant Notifications</h3>
          <p>Get alerts the moment a matching job is posted</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
          <h3>Mobile First</h3>
          <p>Access jobs anytime, anywhere with our mobile app</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Create your profile with education, age, qualifications</p>
      <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Our AI matches you with eligible jobs</p>
      <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Get personalized recommendations daily</p>
      <p><strong>Step 4:</strong> Apply directly through official government portals</p>

      <h2>Coverage</h2>
      <p>We cover jobs from:</p>
      <ul style="margin-left: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <li>Staff Selection Commission (SSC)</li>
        <li>Railway Recruitment Board (RRB)</li>
        <li>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC)</li>
        <li>Public Sector Undertakings (PSUs)</li>
        <li>State Public Service Commissions</li>
        <li>Defense Services (Army, Navy, Air Force)</li>
        <li>Banking (IBPS, SBI, RBI)</li>
        <li>State Government Departments</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What Makes Us Different</h2>
      <p><strong>1. Accuracy:</strong> We verify job details from official sources to ensure accuracy</p>
      <p><strong>2. Transparency:</strong> Clear eligibility criteria for every job</p>
      <p><strong>3. Privacy:</strong> Your data is secure and never sold to third parties</p>
      <p><strong>4. Support:</strong> Dedicated customer support to help you succeed</p>
      <p><strong>5. Technology:</strong> Built with modern AI and cloud infrastructure</p>

      <h2>Our Values</h2>
      <p><strong>🎯 User-First:</strong> Every feature is designed with job seekers in mind</p>
      <p><strong>🔒 Privacy:</strong> Your personal information is protected and confidential</p>
      <p><strong>✨ Innovation:</strong> Continuous improvement using the latest AI technology</p>
      <p><strong>🤝 Integrity:</strong> Honest, transparent, and trustworthy service</p>
      <p><strong>🇮🇳 Made in India:</strong> Built by Indians, for Indians</p>

      <div style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);color:white;padding:40px;border-radius:12px;text-align:center;margin:40px 0;">
        <h2 style="color:white;">Ready to Find Your Dream Government Job?</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom:20px;">Join thousands of job seekers who trust GovFitAI</p>
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary" style="color:#667eea;">Get Started Free →</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Have questions or feedback? We'd love to hear from you!</p>
      <p><strong>Email:</strong> govfitai.com@gmail.com</p>
      <p><strong>Website:</strong> https://govfitai.com</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
